# 富文本编辑器组件 (text / 文本组件规范)

When the user says text 组件, 文本组件, 富文本, or text / 文本组件规范, use this shared component only:

- Implementation: `assets/richtext-editor.js` (`BSRichText.render` / `BSRichText.wire`)
- Do not fork a second toolbar in section schemas, product detail, or theme editor panels
- When the user names this component for a change, update the shared implementation so every caller gets the change. Do not patch one screen only.

## Toolbar layout (must match)

Single compact row (no wrap):

1. Block format control as `Aa` + chevron (not the word Paragraph)
2. Bold
3. Italic
4. Bulleted list
5. Numbered list
6. Link
7. More (`...`)

Collapsed inside More:

- Text color
- Highlight
- Insert icon

## Dynamic source menu

Connected chip / bound field menu items:

1. Change dynamic source
2. Edit value
3. Remove dynamic source

Remove hover must use the warning red bar (same as image Remove): background `#FEE1E6`, text/icon `#8E0B21`. Apply via `button.danger` on `[data-rt-remove-source]`.

Related collection-source Remove in `online-store/js/app.js` (`.os-op-source-remove`) must use the same tokens.

## Height (Content / autoHeight)

Content-like fields and `autoHeight` richtext must not waste vertical space:

1. Empty: one line high
2. Filled: height fits the content lines; no spare blank row

Shared fit lives in `refreshAutoHeight` (`assets/richtext-editor.js`). Content textareas use `.os-ta-fit` in `online-store/js/app.js`.

## Rules

- Keep the toolbar on one line; use the Aa icon for paragraph/heading format
- Expose exactly those five formatting controls on the main toolbar
- Keep color, highlight, and insert-icon under More
- All `control: 'richtext'` fields and product richtext surfaces must use this design
- Paragraph list and More panel stay inside the right panel / viewport; outside click collapses them
